      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Bumping this feedback request because I'm very adamant that this needs to be a thing before this feature goes live.\n\nI'm noticing multiple instances of people opting into the beta, not realizing this feature is on by default, and feeling really embarrassed that they've been making typos and drafting responses they never intended for people to see because there is zero indication of this being a thing inside the keyboard itself.\n\nWhile some kind of \"your message is being sent live!\" message could work, I really just think implementing a toggle for the feature inside the keyboard would clue people into its existence and provide immediate feedback on how their messages are being sent. It'd solve two problems with one solution.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
